<InfoPage title="About Lovescape" kicker="About this publication" description="How this independent publication compares Lovescape characters, chat, generated media, Chips, privacy, safety, and alternatives."><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We help adults evaluate AI companion products before sharing time, private stories, or money. Coverage focuses on character consistency, conversation, generated-media workflow, consent, privacy, deletion, moderation, and total cost.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This publication is not the official Lovescape product and is not operated by or endorsed by its provider. Official links open lovescape.com. Verify current features, policies, Chip costs, and prices before paying.</p><h2>Editorial method</h2><p>Each comparison answers a different reader decision, distinguishes provider claims from editorial judgment, and cites primary sources. We correct material errors and avoid interchangeable product-name pages.</p></InfoPage>
